>DDSCAT allocating     5.72 MB for ICOMP;  total=    47.30 MB                 
>DDSCAT allocating     1.91 MB for IOCC;   total=    49.21 MB                 
>DDSCAT allocating     5.72 MB for ISCR1;  total=    54.93 MB                 
